00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:18,600
The Ancient Thunder Dragon was born from lightning.

22
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,000
The legends say that back then,

23
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,730
it wielded the Divine Retributions on behalf of the law of the heavens.

24
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,400
If I rely on my own strength,

25
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:28,040
I'll never escape it.

26
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:33,690
But if I borrow the power of the Abyss,

27
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,960
I still have a glimmer of hope.

28
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,160
Now or never !

29
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,930
Stop !

30
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,880
The cave I saw before

31
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:05,960
should be nearby.

32
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,800
If I can enter it,

33
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,000
I can use it to resist the suction force.

34
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,520
Found it !

35
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:30,010
Cave at the bottom
of the Tide Abyss

36
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,600
I did it !

37
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,250
How could there be

38
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,200
a teleportation formation here !?

39
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:45,040
With the Stop spell, I could slay this beast.

40
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:47,480
But since it is at death's door

41
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,730
this is the perfect chance to devour it.

42
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,400
Fortune favors the brave.

43
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,680
Seeking the Dao is risky.

44
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,920
Soul Devourer !

45
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,250
Absorb !

46
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:46,890
1 year later

47
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:11,000
I only refined 20% of the Ancient Thunder Dragon

48
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:14,320
but my Origin Soul has already transformed into a Thunder Dragon.

49
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:17,680
Trying to destroy my Origin Soul now

50
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,610
would be the same as trying to destroy Divine Retribution lightning.

51
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,960
My spells also contain the might of this heavenly lightning.

52
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,800
With this lightning power,

53
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,640
I could even fight a Late stage Ascendant cultivator.

54
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,200
My Origin Soul can't leave my body anymore !

55
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,880
I suppose this barrier

56
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,800
must be the price for transforming my Origin Soul.

57
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,920
I wonder how Senior Zhou Yi is doing

58
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,040
and where the Mosquito Beast is.

59
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,720
My teleportation failed,

60
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:47,840
the Earth Escape is blocked.

61
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:51,120
I can't even use the token to enter the Celestial Cave.

62
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,120
This place

63
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:57,200
is actually a dead end.

64
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,560
Wh...

65
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,960
What is that lightning

66
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,480
in your eyes !?

67
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:19,480
Back then, you said you knew the Tide Abyss very well

68
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:22,120
and knew how to escape from this place.

69
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,360
This place...

70
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,640
Where are we ?

71
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,200
The...

72
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:31,320
The bottom of the Abyss !

73
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,210
I only ever scouted on the periphery.

74
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,770
I never thought I'd come to the bottom !

75
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,600
I don't know how to get out either !

76
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,280
Useless.

77
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,600
Wait !

78
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,170
I don't know the way out

79
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,680
but I know the All-Seer's secret !

80
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,810
As long as you're willing to release me,

81
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,640
I will tell you !

82
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,250
Speak.

83
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,320
You

84
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,720
must swear on your Dao Heart !

85
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:02,120
I saw Master devour Sun Yun !

86
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,090
For a long time,

87
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,320
disciples of the Heavenly Fate Sect rarely reached the 2nd step.

88
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,040
There are many speculations about this.

89
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,280
Among them

90
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,000
the most widespread theory is

91
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,880
that the All-Seer refines his own domain

92
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,360
by devouring his 2nd step disciples.

93
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,480
I didn't believe it at the time

94
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,920
until that day.

95
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:24,440
The technique I cultivate can absorb spiritual energy from beasts.

96
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,800
That day,

97
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,320
while I was devouring a mountain spirit beast,

98
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:30,040
I unintentionally saw its memories.

99
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,400
That mountain spirit beast had witnessed

100
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,320
the battle between Master and Sun Yun

101
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,400
with its own eyes.

102
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,400
Back then, the two were dueling in the sky.

103
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:41,440
Initially, Sun Yun could fight Master to a draw.

104
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,120
But at the critical moment,

105
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,600
a strange mark lit up on Sun Yun's forehead

106
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,920
which caused him to lose instantly.

107
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,880
And the next second,

108
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,520
he was devoured alive by Master !

109
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:55,080
In that moment, I understood

110
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,960
that those terrible rumors

111
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,640
were all true.

112
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:01,200
A strange mark ?

113
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,360
Was it this one ?

114
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,480
Exactly !

115
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,120
At that time,

116
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:10,160
was Master wearing a gray robe ?

117
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,560
It was gray !

118
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,400
I did find it a bit strange,

119
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:16,170
I had never seen Master wear a gray robe before !

120
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:18,240
Back in the Ancient Demon Inheritance,

121
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,960
I already sensed this slaughter energy was problematic.

122
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:24,760
Sun Yun must have seen through the All-Seer's scheme before that

123
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,790
which is why he didn't cultivate it to completion.

124
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,840
But he still couldn't escape being devoured...

125
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,720
It looks like

126
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,320
the spells the All-Seer passes on to his disciples

127
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,720
are also the shackles he places on them.

128
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,930
I can't stay on Planet Tian Yun

129
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:40,960
any longer.

130
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:47,080
This person is ruthless.

131
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,360
I can't just wait for death here !

132
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,650
Unfortunately, my cultivation is too low.

133
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,760
But...

134
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,880
maybe I can reach Ascendant !

135
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:58,400
Although my Origin Soul is sealed right now,

136
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,880
by borrowing Ascendant origin energy

137
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,080
I might be able to breakthrough.

138
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,600
Reaching Ascendant

139
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,120
isn't entirely hopeless !

140
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,360
Did he just read my thoughts ?

141
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:17,160
Celestial Emperor Qing Lin's jade slip recorded the Shadow Escape.

142
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:19,810
But it can only be used by a Celestial Guard...

143
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,760
It might be my chance to escape.

144
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,400
Although the success rate of refining one is slim,

145
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,520
I have no choice but to try.

146
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:29,120
You have one chance.

147
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,720
If you can reach Ascendant,

148
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:34,120
I will grant you a great fortune

149
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,600
to help you reach Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang.

150
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,640
But the condition is

151
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:42,000
that you will let me refine you into a Celestial Guard

152
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:44,360
and serve me for 1000 years.

153
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,200
A Celestial Guard ?

154
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,330
Will I retain my consciousness ?

155
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,570
If you're still alive in 1000 years,

156
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:53,000
I will give you back your freedom and your consciousness.

157
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,360
I will gamble !

158
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,400
I will gamble on me living 1000 years !

159
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,650
Alright,

160
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,000
I am willing !

161
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,000
Now that he's Ascendant,

162
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,410
he's ready to become a Celestial Guard.

163
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,760
Next,

164
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,040
I must refine his physical body.

165
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,080
Unfortunately,

166
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,560
he only achieved copper-rank strength...

167
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,960
Since his body is too weak,

168
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:35,080
I'll have to borrow the Heavenly Ghosts' strength.

169
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:40,530
Note: Wang Lin obtained the Heavenly Ghost from Luo Yun of the Heavenly Ghost Sect when he arrived in the Demon Spirit Land.

170
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:42,930
Refine !

171
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:04,330
6 months later

172
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:13,130
Celestial Guard Du Jian
Illusory Yin

173
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,400
An Illusory Yin puppet !

174
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,640
Celestial Emperor Qing Lin truly had impressive means.

175
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,600
Conceal !

176
00:12:20,160 --> 00:12:21,770
With the Celestial Guard's Shadow Escape,

177
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:23,720
I have a 60% chance to leave this place.

178
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,200
When the token was taking shape,

179
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,000
I failed to get the last sword.

180
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:31,360
If my guess is correct,

181
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:34,000
the token condensed from the purple mist

182
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:37,120
is the token that fell in the tide back then.

183
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:40,880
This token is the key to opening the true Celestial Cave.

184
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,930
The All-Seer and the others have coveted it for too long

185
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,320
so I must hide it carefully.

186
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,880
I obtained 7 of the 12 Swords' swords.

187
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,250
With them, I can use the Seven Star Sword Formation.

188
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,800
If I also channel it with Divine Retribution Lightning,

189
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,690
it will become even stronger !

190
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,720
Just these artifacts

191
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,760
are not enough.

192
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,960
Maybe...

193
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,600
Wealth...

194
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:10,680
Let me have a look

195
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:12,680
at the secrets you are hiding.

196
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,600
The Heavenly Chop !?

197
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,920
Do you know

198
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:26,200
the meaning of 'Chopping the net' ?

199
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,080
I don't.

200
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:31,320
Observe the sentient beings

201
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,920
to obtain the essence of this technique.

202
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,600
The sentient beings...

203
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:48,560
The words 'Chopping the net'...

204
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:51,640
What's the connection between them ?

205
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:10,810
3 years later

206
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:14,450
Chopping the net...

207
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,720
What does 'Chopping the net' mean ?

208
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,320
I get it !

209
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,840
The heavens are a net.

210
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,120
All sentient beings

211
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,890
are intertwined in a myriad of ways.

212
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:41,000
We are all bound by the rules of the heavens and the earth.

213
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,920
From birth to death,

214
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,280
we all live in a net.

215
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,040
And the Heavenly Chop

216
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,560
severs this very net of heaven and earth.

217
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,640
It severs

218
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:55,520
the rules that govern all sentient beings !

219
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,520
Once this sword is used,

220
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:06,680
it can sever one's destiny

221
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,800
and defy the rules !

222
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,330
This is

223
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,760
the Heavenly Chop !

224
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:15,890
Heavenly Chop

225
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,810
Sever !

226
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,240
In just a few years,

227
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,600
the suction force has increased a lot.

228
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,720
Could there be something else

229
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:47,040
at the bottom of the Abyss ?

230
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,680
I painstakingly comprehended the Heavenly Chop

231
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:53,000
thinking I could finally escape

232
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,600
only for it to be all in vain.

233
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,440
Fate...

234
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,240
Destiny...

235
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:03,520
Everyone’s happiness is different…

236
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:06,000
What I seek

237
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,760
is to accompany my parents,

238
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,840
to accompany Wan'er...

239
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:16,080
Yet the Dao I have chosen

240
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,560
is one of solitude.

241
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:23,440
Since it has come to this,

242
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,240
I won't overthink it.

243
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,680
I might as well use the time I have

244
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:32,320
to extract the slaughter energy from my body.

245
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,320
The Life Seals are just a manifestation

246
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:55,840
of the slaughter energy deeply planted within me.

247
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,560
It's bearable

248
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:09,720
but not enough !

249
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:14,840
Suction force,

250
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:16,360
come at me !

251
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,680
Show yourselves !

252
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:26,200
1 083 222 strands of slaughter energy,

253
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,840
the exact same number of Life Seals I have.

254
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,960
The suction force isn't strong enough...

255
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,600
Celestial Guard,

256
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:56,770
Shadow Escape !

257
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:36,730
6 months later

258
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:57,120
My million Life Seals

259
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,640
have finally been removed !

260
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:16,880
Greed !

261
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:19,480
I ordered you to protect my disciples !

262
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:21,280
How could they have died like this !?

263
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,520
The compass has been giving frequent warnings lately.

264
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,800
Xi Xue...

265
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:39,320
What exactly have you encountered ?

266
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:41,680
Fellow cultivators,

267
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:45,240
I wish to advance the opening of the Demon Spirit Land

268
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,840
by 10 years.

269
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,880
Does anyone have any objections ?

270
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:51,000
I agree.

271
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:51,800
I agree !

272
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:55,640
Wang Lin,

273
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:58,880
you dared to forcibly remove the Life Seals.

274
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:01,080
Since that's the case,

275
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:04,000
I can't let you live.

276
00:20:06,120 --> 00:22:40,210
Celestial Guards are split into the following ranks: gold, silver, copper, iron. Gold being the strongest and iron being the weakest.

277
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:32,730
Ask

278
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:30,650
Qi Condensation

279
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:32,810
